WEBVTT

00:36.619 --> 00:38.538
Boss! Boss!

00:40.540 --> 00:42.542
- What is that?
- Hey, you masked bastard.

00:42.625 --> 00:44.001
Now you're dead meat.

00:44.126 --> 00:45.962
Hey, attack him!

00:46.504 --> 00:47.838
Attack him, quickly!

00:47.922 --> 00:49.840
Hey, hurry up!

00:58.140 --> 00:59.141
What the hell?

01:11.988 --> 01:13.656
This bastard. Hey, hey, get up.

01:13.739 --> 01:14.991
Hey, you bastard! Get over here!

01:15.074 --> 01:16.534
Huh? Come on!

01:17.076 --> 01:18.744
Hey, he's alive. Damn it.

01:23.457 --> 01:24.584
The bathroom.

01:24.917 --> 01:26.711
Hey, there's big trouble in the bathroom.

01:27.295 --> 01:29.171
- Get to the bathroom, now!
- You bastard!

01:36.512 --> 01:37.513
Kang-sik!

01:40.766 --> 01:41.767
Boss.

01:44.437 --> 01:45.438
Hey!

01:45.521 --> 01:46.522
Go!

01:53.988 --> 01:54.989
Hey, lock the door!

02:00.244 --> 02:01.245
You!

02:39.659 --> 02:40.826
In-gu!

03:27.665 --> 03:28.666
You hear that?

03:28.749 --> 03:30.960
It means you're a dead man.

03:33.587 --> 03:34.588
Damn it.

04:06.370 --> 04:08.122
- What?
- What the?

04:08.205 --> 04:11.250
- Turn on the lights!
- What the hell?

04:11.417 --> 04:13.878
- Where did he go?
- Hey, find him, quick!

04:13.961 --> 04:15.254
Find him, now!

04:56.921 --> 04:58.214
ORAN CHINESE RESTAURANT

04:58.297 --> 04:59.465
EPISODE 4

05:18.234 --> 05:19.485
Where have you been?

05:19.735 --> 05:21.529
You weren't answering your phone.
Ho-myeong.

05:21.821 --> 05:23.614
It's an emergency, so be quiet...

05:25.574 --> 05:27.284
What happened to your face? Are you hurt?

05:27.409 --> 05:29.995
I just fell off my motorcycle.

05:30.913 --> 05:32.331
- I need some rest.
- Good grief.

05:32.706 --> 05:33.749
I need to talk to you.

05:34.458 --> 05:35.626
You two can head home first.

05:35.709 --> 05:38.045
All right, then. You two wrap
things up and come along.

05:38.337 --> 05:39.880
- Okay, let's go.
- Hold on.

05:40.047 --> 05:42.007
We should hear what happened too.

05:42.800 --> 05:43.801
We need to go now.

05:43.884 --> 05:44.885
It's time to go.

05:44.969 --> 05:45.970
Let's go.

05:58.649 --> 05:59.650
Talk to me.

06:00.943 --> 06:03.988
You haven't answered your phone all day.

06:04.613 --> 06:06.198
So why are you crawling in now,
looking like that?

06:08.367 --> 06:09.660
I was out on a delivery...

06:10.369 --> 06:13.831
I crashed my bike, and when I came to,
it was already this late.

06:13.956 --> 06:15.040
Where?

06:15.374 --> 06:17.543
Mr. Kim said he drove
all around the neighborhood

06:17.668 --> 06:18.961
and didn't see you.

06:19.628 --> 06:20.880
Let's talk about it later.

06:21.881 --> 06:22.882
Tell me before you go.

06:23.090 --> 06:25.217
- Can't you see I'm hurt?
- Exactly.

06:25.301 --> 06:27.720
Where were you
and what were you doing to get so hurt...

06:27.928 --> 06:29.638
that you didn't go pick up Ji-woo?

06:32.892 --> 06:33.893
Don't tell me...

06:34.393 --> 06:35.811
you just remembered now?

06:36.937 --> 06:39.189
Are you out of your mind? Ji-woo...

06:40.482 --> 06:42.026
That six-year-old boy...

06:42.109 --> 06:43.903
Because you never showed up

06:43.986 --> 06:47.072
he walked home by himself for 30 minutes.

06:47.156 --> 06:48.198
Is Ji-woo okay?

06:48.282 --> 06:49.325
And that makes it okay?

06:49.783 --> 06:51.327
What if on his way home alone...

06:52.369 --> 06:53.662
he'd gotten into an accident?

06:54.038 --> 06:56.415
What would you have done
if he'd gotten lost?

07:00.502 --> 07:01.503
I'm sorry.

07:01.921 --> 07:02.922
You're sorry?

07:03.172 --> 07:04.173
For what?

07:04.340 --> 07:06.675
Why are you always like this, huh?

07:06.759 --> 07:08.761
Why can't you just tell me straight?

07:12.514 --> 07:14.683
You're just going to clam up like that?

08:00.688 --> 08:06.944
7 YEARS AGO

08:09.947 --> 08:10.948
Seong-won, I...

08:11.657 --> 08:12.992
I'm getting married.

08:13.075 --> 08:15.744
O-ran's... pregnant.

08:16.537 --> 08:18.789
Hey, you idiot!
How could you be so careless?

08:19.039 --> 08:20.207
Is this really the time
for you to get married?

08:20.457 --> 08:23.210
- What about the operation?
- Getting married won't change anything.

08:23.293 --> 08:25.295
My revenge on Han Gyeong-wook,
finding Bulgae...

08:25.379 --> 08:26.630
everything will proceed without a hitch.

08:26.714 --> 08:28.257
You think it's as easy as it sounds?

08:29.591 --> 08:31.760
What are you going to do when the time
comes to choose between them?

08:31.844 --> 08:33.345
Why are you being so negative?

08:33.429 --> 08:34.513
I can do both.

08:35.097 --> 08:36.557
Jeez, Ho-myeong.

08:36.807 --> 08:38.267
Do you know why I never got married?

08:38.350 --> 08:39.351
I thought it was because you couldn't.

08:41.770 --> 08:43.063
I've also spent my life

08:43.147 --> 08:46.400
thinking a family would just get
in the way of the operation.

08:46.859 --> 08:48.068
But, no.

08:49.611 --> 08:52.406
The moment Oran told me about the baby,
I realized something.

08:53.407 --> 08:54.908
That for my family...

08:56.452 --> 08:58.120
there's nothing I wouldn't do.

09:11.091 --> 09:12.551
Hey, President Yoo.

09:12.968 --> 09:14.136
Are you okay?

09:14.219 --> 09:15.220
You feeling all right?

09:15.721 --> 09:17.306
How did you know I was here?

09:17.765 --> 09:19.767
Come on. Of course I had to visit.

09:19.850 --> 09:21.685
A coworker got hurt.

09:23.145 --> 09:24.146
But...

09:24.730 --> 09:25.981
this isn't a private room.

09:30.569 --> 09:31.737
Could you move aside?

09:34.698 --> 09:36.450
Who the hell are you
to tell a patient to move?

09:37.743 --> 09:39.411
- Hey!
- Damn it.

09:41.330 --> 09:42.331
Everyone, get out.

09:42.414 --> 09:43.415
Yes, Boss.

09:43.707 --> 09:44.708
All of you, get out.

09:44.792 --> 09:45.793
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

09:45.876 --> 09:46.919
Out, out, out, out.

09:56.136 --> 09:58.097
You're more hurt than I thought.

09:59.848 --> 10:01.183
That son of a bitch.

10:01.266 --> 10:03.143
I heard it was just one guy
who did all this.

10:03.685 --> 10:04.895
Is this for real?

10:04.978 --> 10:05.979
The almighty Ingu Sect?

10:06.063 --> 10:08.816
Stay out of what happens on my turf.

10:08.982 --> 10:09.983
No way.

10:10.150 --> 10:12.277
I'd love to stay out of it.
But you know how it is.

10:12.569 --> 10:14.822
The day after tomorrow,
I have to report to Chief Han

10:14.905 --> 10:17.032
on the Yeongseon Island project.

10:17.491 --> 10:20.536
All right, the security room incident,
that's number one. And...

10:20.994 --> 10:22.162
this one is number two.

10:22.496 --> 10:25.082
With all this trouble
happening with Heaven Capital

10:25.165 --> 10:27.835
I'm not quite sure what stance to take.
It's putting me in a tough spot.

10:28.043 --> 10:29.044
You know?

10:30.671 --> 10:31.713
Hey, Chairman Do.

10:31.880 --> 10:33.799
You think I can't clean up
a mess like this?

10:34.842 --> 10:36.260
Watch your mouth.

10:37.261 --> 10:38.637
Keep running your mouth like that...

10:40.013 --> 10:41.014
and you'll end up dead.

10:45.978 --> 10:48.188
I know, I know.

10:48.730 --> 10:51.567
I know exactly
what you're capable of, President Yoo.

10:51.650 --> 10:53.485
That's why we're in the same boat.

10:53.861 --> 10:57.364
As long as this business goes smoothly

10:57.447 --> 10:58.824
I have no problem.

10:59.867 --> 11:00.868
No problem.

11:01.869 --> 11:02.870
Oh.

11:03.370 --> 11:04.371
Vitamins.

11:04.454 --> 11:05.455
Please.

11:06.415 --> 11:08.792
Make sure you take these vitamins

11:10.335 --> 11:11.336
and get well soon.

11:11.420 --> 11:12.421
Get better.

11:12.504 --> 11:13.505
Goodbye.

11:14.715 --> 11:16.800
We'll talk business next time.

11:17.467 --> 11:18.468
Bye.

11:19.094 --> 11:20.095
See you.

11:26.143 --> 11:27.144
Why...

11:28.604 --> 11:30.606
What is it, boss?

11:30.689 --> 11:32.983
- What is it?
- Go bring me that Masked Bastard.

11:33.609 --> 11:34.610
Boss, I...

11:35.194 --> 11:36.778
How am I supposed to find him
when we don't know who he is?

11:38.197 --> 11:40.365
Hey, you moron! Isn't it obvious?

11:40.449 --> 11:42.242
The guy who took down
our Ingu Sect all by himself

11:42.409 --> 11:44.036
who else holds a grudge against us?

11:44.119 --> 11:45.829
Who else could it be
but that Martial Arts Master

11:45.913 --> 11:47.289
we beat up and took his house deed from?

11:47.372 --> 11:49.041
But his fighting style...

11:49.124 --> 11:50.500
it felt different
from the masked guy's. Right?

11:50.584 --> 11:52.753
- Yeah.
- Forget his damn fighting style

11:52.836 --> 11:54.129
and just go get him!

11:54.254 --> 11:55.255
We'll know...

11:55.339 --> 11:56.673
- We'll get him
- When we beat it out of him! Damn it!

11:57.966 --> 11:59.051
I'll get him.

11:59.259 --> 12:00.260
Damn it.

12:03.847 --> 12:07.017
SEOUL METROPOLITAN POLICE AGENCY

12:15.234 --> 12:16.235
Hey.

12:16.985 --> 12:18.779
- Did you look into what I asked?
- Yes.

12:19.404 --> 12:21.240
The most important part you need to see

12:21.323 --> 12:22.324
is on page three.

12:24.868 --> 12:27.162
This is the Hwasan Sect's
organizational chart from ten years ago.

12:27.329 --> 12:29.081
At the time, the boss, Hwang Hwa-san

12:29.164 --> 12:31.416
was charged with soliciting
the murder of Kwon Soon-bok

12:31.500 --> 12:33.252
and after he received a life sentence,
the sect fell apart.

12:33.585 --> 12:34.962
The second-in-command, Gang Beom-ryong

12:35.045 --> 12:36.421
suddenly disappeared without a trace.

12:36.505 --> 12:37.589
So he's missing?

12:38.006 --> 12:39.007
It's hard to say.

12:39.216 --> 12:41.969
In any case, there's no record
of any activity after that.

12:42.177 --> 12:43.762
And so, naturally

12:43.845 --> 12:45.597
the number three, Yoo In-gu

12:45.681 --> 12:47.724
ended up taking over
the entire Hwasan Sect.

12:48.225 --> 12:49.977
He even changed the gang's name from the
Hwasan Sect

12:50.060 --> 12:51.144
to the Ingu Sect

12:51.228 --> 12:53.188
and expanded their influence.

12:53.272 --> 12:54.940
Yoo In-gu.

12:55.691 --> 12:56.942
Have his whereabouts been confirmed?

12:57.025 --> 12:58.819
Yes. It's on the last page.

13:00.779 --> 13:02.739
It's called Heaven Capital
on Yeongseon Island

13:02.906 --> 13:04.074
located inside Heaven Casino.

13:04.157 --> 13:05.951
His most recent move was registering it

13:06.034 --> 13:07.327
as a private lending company.

13:07.411 --> 13:08.412
Wait a minute.

13:08.787 --> 13:09.871
Did you say Yeongseon Island?

13:10.163 --> 13:12.082
Yes. Is there a problem?

13:16.169 --> 13:17.879
YEONGSEON ISLAND

13:20.799 --> 13:22.509
Yeongseon Island.

13:23.343 --> 13:24.386
So...

13:24.469 --> 13:25.595
you came back empty-handed?

13:26.305 --> 13:29.057
See? This is why I told you
not to go off on your own.

13:29.182 --> 13:32.102
By the way,
the jerky factory seemed suspicious.

13:32.561 --> 13:34.479
- I thought we should hit it...
- Stop it!

13:34.855 --> 13:36.064
Don't you dare go there alone.

13:36.148 --> 13:37.274
Why not?

13:37.357 --> 13:38.442
I can handle it.

13:38.525 --> 13:39.526
Ho-myeong.

13:39.609 --> 13:41.069
You're not the man you used to be.

13:41.153 --> 13:43.030
You need to face reality.

13:43.572 --> 13:45.574
If you get hurt,
what will you tell your family?

13:46.408 --> 13:48.410
You know that Prosecutor Gang I mentioned?

13:48.785 --> 13:50.829
I think we're just about to entangle her.

13:51.204 --> 13:52.789
So until then, just lay low

13:52.873 --> 13:54.374
and go score some points with your wife.

13:56.293 --> 13:57.961
What's with the sudden advice?

13:58.378 --> 13:59.713
It's not like you're a marriage counselor.

14:00.172 --> 14:02.424
I just hate seeing you
so down in the dumps.

14:02.924 --> 14:04.384
Didn't you say you could handle both?

14:07.888 --> 14:09.014
So just do that and lay low.

14:09.473 --> 14:11.183
And absolutely no acting
on your own. Got it?

14:11.433 --> 14:12.434
I'm hanging up.

14:29.117 --> 14:30.160
Did you find anything?

14:30.243 --> 14:31.244
Yes.

14:32.204 --> 14:33.455
The masked assailant...

14:33.538 --> 14:34.873
It seems President Yoo's men

14:34.956 --> 14:36.458
are desperately looking for him.

14:37.751 --> 14:40.921
The rumor is he's the one who caused
the problem in the security office.

14:41.254 --> 14:42.923
In any case,
he's clearly not your average guy.

14:43.090 --> 14:44.925
He single-handedly
wiped out the Ingu Sect.

14:45.008 --> 14:46.510
Of course he's not average.

14:46.802 --> 14:47.969
Follow up on that

14:48.053 --> 14:49.763
in more detail.

14:49.846 --> 14:50.889
- Understood.
- Also.

14:51.014 --> 14:53.308
Did you look into that jerky business
I mentioned?

14:53.683 --> 14:55.560
They're disguising drugs from China

14:55.644 --> 14:57.729
as beef jerky and distributing them.

14:57.896 --> 14:59.106
Besides our casino

14:59.189 --> 15:01.983
they have a pretty solid
distribution network set up nationwide.

15:02.442 --> 15:04.903
Goodness... Well, I'll be.

15:06.196 --> 15:07.197
Let's see.

15:07.280 --> 15:08.865
The monthly volume is...

15:08.949 --> 15:10.242
REPORT ON YOO IN-GU
AND COMPANY'S DRUG TRAFFICKING

15:11.034 --> 15:12.035
ESTIMATED MONTHLY DISTRIBUTION VOLUME
50KG

15:12.119 --> 15:13.703
Fifty kilograms.

15:14.079 --> 15:15.705
Wow. And the revenue...

15:16.581 --> 15:17.749
Ten, one hundred thousand,
one million, ten million...

15:19.000 --> 15:20.001
Fifteen billion won.

15:22.587 --> 15:24.339
Man, this Yoo In-gu.

15:25.132 --> 15:27.759
He's got a better head
for business than I thought.

15:27.843 --> 15:29.761
To think he built such a cash cow.

15:30.929 --> 15:32.013
What should we do?

15:32.639 --> 15:34.015
This jerky business...

15:34.307 --> 15:37.185
There could be some serious synergy
if we link it to our casino.

15:37.269 --> 15:38.812
If we passed it around the VIP rooms

15:38.895 --> 15:40.063
it could be very lucrative.

15:40.147 --> 15:41.148
This...

15:41.648 --> 15:42.899
There's no reason not to do it, is there?

15:46.736 --> 15:47.737
Let's see.

15:48.113 --> 15:50.449
So all we have to do
is get rid of President Yoo

15:50.532 --> 15:51.908
and we'll be all set.

15:54.077 --> 15:56.204
But making an open move...

15:56.621 --> 15:58.123
is a bit risky.

15:58.790 --> 16:00.041
Do you have a plan?

16:00.125 --> 16:01.835
The enemy's gates down.

16:02.210 --> 16:04.004
but only from the inside.

16:04.463 --> 16:05.630
What does that mean?

16:06.840 --> 16:09.885
The gates of an enemy's fortress
can only be opened from the inside.

16:10.260 --> 16:12.304
Let's find a gatekeeper
who'll throw the gates

16:12.721 --> 16:13.930
wide open for us.

16:20.687 --> 16:22.689
Damn it.

16:24.983 --> 16:26.193
Hey, you find anything?

16:26.359 --> 16:27.444
Boss.

16:27.527 --> 16:28.653
Looks like he already took off.

16:29.112 --> 16:31.156
Yeah, it sure looks like it. Damn it.

16:31.865 --> 16:33.533
Where the hell
are we supposed to find him?

16:34.284 --> 16:35.285
Hey, Boss!

16:35.368 --> 16:36.786
- Look at this.
- What is it?

16:37.245 --> 16:38.455
Remember Martial Arts Master?

16:38.663 --> 16:40.040
He said he worked at an office, didn't he?

16:41.458 --> 16:44.085
I'm just an ordinary office worker.

16:44.419 --> 16:46.505
Just... an office worker.

16:48.882 --> 16:51.176
Well, look at the brains on this one.

16:51.301 --> 16:53.553
Hey, pull up the address for this company.

16:53.637 --> 16:54.763
- Got it?
- Right away, sir.

16:54.846 --> 16:57.015
Let's move. Come on, boys, let's go!

16:57.098 --> 16:58.808
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

17:05.023 --> 17:06.983
Buying this is our little
secret from Mom, okay?

17:07.609 --> 17:08.860
I know.

17:08.944 --> 17:10.570
You keep it a secret too, Dad.

17:14.157 --> 17:15.700
I'm sorry about yesterday.

17:16.159 --> 17:17.536
I made you walk home by yourself.

17:18.370 --> 17:19.412
But, Dad...

17:19.663 --> 17:20.997
Why didn't you come yesterday?

17:21.498 --> 17:23.083
Did you have too many deliveries?

17:32.842 --> 17:33.843
Well...

17:35.011 --> 17:37.305
You know your favorite, Masked Racer?

17:37.722 --> 17:39.766
He has to go right away
when he gets a call, right?

17:41.476 --> 17:42.644
Well, Dad also

17:43.019 --> 17:44.521
got called to action yesterday, too.

17:45.605 --> 17:48.483
You got called to fight bad guys, too?

17:49.859 --> 17:51.903
Whoa, that's so cool.

17:53.989 --> 17:55.532
This is a secret from Mom, too.

17:55.699 --> 17:56.700
Why?

17:57.158 --> 17:59.494
You should've told Mom
you were on a mission.

17:59.953 --> 18:01.496
Mom's really angry.

18:02.163 --> 18:04.874
- Really?
- Grandpa said

18:05.166 --> 18:07.419
that she won't get over it
easily this time.

18:10.922 --> 18:13.758
Dad, I asked I-seo

18:14.217 --> 18:16.511
and she said there's a way
to calm Mom down.

18:17.804 --> 18:18.805
What is it?

18:19.472 --> 18:21.099
No matter how mad she gets

18:21.182 --> 18:23.184
if you compliment her, give her a gift

18:23.393 --> 18:25.228
and take her on a date,
she'll get over it.

18:25.645 --> 18:27.022
- A date?
- Dad.

18:27.772 --> 18:29.065
Do you see that?

18:31.610 --> 18:33.570
MASKED RACER'S GREAT ADVENTURE

18:40.452 --> 18:41.453
Oh, my back.

18:45.165 --> 18:47.792
Jeez, where did that guy go now?

18:57.385 --> 18:58.803
Yeongseon Food?

19:03.141 --> 19:05.268
YEONGSEON FOOD

19:07.103 --> 19:08.855
- Hey, get him!
- Get him!

19:08.938 --> 19:10.857
- What do you think you're doing?
- Get in there!

19:11.941 --> 19:14.194
Whoa, hold on there! Just a second.

19:14.986 --> 19:16.446
Hey, it's all right. Come on.

19:16.529 --> 19:17.530
- Come over here.
- Me?

19:17.614 --> 19:18.990
It's all right.

19:20.200 --> 19:21.493
It's fine.

19:22.077 --> 19:23.078
Come here.

19:23.787 --> 19:26.956
- I just want to ask you something, okay?
- Okay...

19:27.248 --> 19:30.377
That guy, Bong Je-sun, works here, right?

19:31.920 --> 19:33.129
Where might that punk be?

19:33.254 --> 19:34.714
PAYSTUB
MANAGER BONG JE-SUN

19:35.298 --> 19:36.299
Manager Bong?

19:37.008 --> 19:38.843
Yeah, Manager Bong.

19:40.136 --> 19:41.930
So where is he? You don't know?

19:42.222 --> 19:43.515
He should be in the factory

19:43.598 --> 19:45.475
on the second floor right now.

19:45.725 --> 19:46.893
Second floor factory? Where is it?

19:48.228 --> 19:49.229
Over there.

19:51.106 --> 19:52.732
Hey, it's the second floor!
Let's go, hurry!

19:52.816 --> 19:53.817
Yes, sir, yes!

19:53.942 --> 19:55.193
Hey! Second floor.

20:00.490 --> 20:01.491
Move it!

20:10.333 --> 20:11.334
Manager Bong!

20:17.507 --> 20:19.759
Manager Bong! What are you doing here?

20:19.843 --> 20:21.636
People were saying
the bathroom was too dirty.

20:21.720 --> 20:22.804
That's not the problem!

20:22.887 --> 20:25.223
There are gangsters outside. Gangsters!

20:25.515 --> 20:28.059
The gangsters are here to get you!

20:28.143 --> 20:29.144
Nam-il.

20:43.992 --> 20:45.368
Nam-il, get up.

20:45.452 --> 20:47.412
What? Uncle, are you off work already?

20:47.495 --> 20:49.664
Gangsters are here! Get up, quick!

20:50.081 --> 20:51.082
Gangsters...

20:51.166 --> 20:52.667
Manager Bong, what are you doing?

20:54.002 --> 20:55.545
Hey, what's this?

20:56.379 --> 20:57.714
I'm sorry, sir. I...

20:58.214 --> 21:00.925
- I'll explain later. I'm sorry.
- Hey! What do you mean, later?

21:01.509 --> 21:02.802
Sir, I'll explain later.

21:03.011 --> 21:04.179
Hey!

21:04.846 --> 21:06.139
Hey! Get him!

21:17.942 --> 21:18.943
Get in, quick!

21:27.035 --> 21:28.036
- That way!
- Got it.

21:36.336 --> 21:38.755
Hey, stop right there!

21:39.005 --> 21:40.089
Hey! There's the bastard!

21:40.173 --> 21:41.466
Get him! Hey, hurry up!

21:43.176 --> 21:44.803
Go, get him!

21:45.762 --> 21:46.971
That hurts!

21:48.473 --> 21:49.474
Get him!

21:52.018 --> 21:53.436
Hey, stop!

21:55.480 --> 21:56.481
Wait, hold on.

22:02.403 --> 22:03.988
Hey, what's going on?

22:04.197 --> 22:05.990
Damn it!

22:12.539 --> 22:13.540
Oh no!

22:13.623 --> 22:17.544
Bensun! No.

22:17.794 --> 22:20.171
My Bensun!

22:22.340 --> 22:24.467
How many times do I have to tell you?

22:24.551 --> 22:25.844
I'll need to see your ID.

22:25.927 --> 22:28.054
I told you, I crossed on yellow.

22:28.429 --> 22:30.557
- Are you blind?
- Your ID, please.

22:30.682 --> 22:31.808
Gosh, seriously.

22:46.072 --> 22:47.073
Here you go.

22:49.993 --> 22:51.744
What a stuck-up bitch.

23:13.933 --> 23:15.101
- What the!
- You startled me.

23:15.476 --> 23:17.312
Oh, I'm sorry. I just...

23:17.395 --> 23:18.813
you were standing out here in the rain.

23:19.814 --> 23:21.316
Oh, it was you.

23:21.858 --> 23:23.943
You have to give out tickets
even in weather like this?

23:24.485 --> 23:25.778
Yeah, pretty much.

23:25.862 --> 23:27.572
Here, please take this.

23:28.114 --> 23:30.033
- What about you?
- The bus drops me off

23:30.450 --> 23:31.826
right in front of my convenience store.

23:31.910 --> 23:33.953
You'll catch a cold if you stand
in the rain for too long.

23:34.037 --> 23:35.830
- That's my bus. I've gotta go.
- Oh, wait!

23:38.458 --> 23:40.501
Hey, wait a minute! Stop, stop!

23:40.585 --> 23:42.503
Hey! Sir, let me get on!

23:42.795 --> 23:44.172
Stop!

23:44.255 --> 23:46.341
Sir, stop! Come on.

23:46.424 --> 23:48.009
I said stop! Please, stop!

24:00.313 --> 24:03.441
Get in. It's on my way.
I'll give you a ride.

24:05.318 --> 24:07.028
No, it's okay, really.

24:07.111 --> 24:08.780
It feels nice and cool. I'm fine.

24:08.863 --> 24:11.324
You know the buses here
only run once an hour, right?

24:12.283 --> 24:13.284
Get in.

24:15.036 --> 24:16.037
But I'm completely soaked.

24:16.120 --> 24:17.413
You're the one who said

24:17.497 --> 24:18.915
you'll catch a cold standing in the rain.

24:20.249 --> 24:21.292
It's fine.

24:28.383 --> 24:29.550
So...

24:30.385 --> 24:31.844
You're a fan of Chow Yun Fat, aren't you?

24:32.303 --> 24:34.430
Whoa! How did you know that?

24:34.514 --> 24:36.933
You popped up
on my "Friends You May Know" list.

24:37.600 --> 24:39.018
Your PFP is Chow Yun Fat, right?

24:39.268 --> 24:41.854
I'm a big fan of his too,
so I just thought I'd mention it.

24:42.105 --> 24:44.273
Wow, really? No way, I had no idea.

24:45.191 --> 24:46.484
Sorry, what's a "PFP"?

24:48.152 --> 24:49.529
Profile picture.

24:50.238 --> 24:51.322
Oh, the picture.

24:52.573 --> 24:53.741
Anyway, A Better Tomorrow...

24:53.825 --> 24:56.911
I remember watching that on VHS
when I was a kid. I loved it.

24:56.995 --> 24:57.996
Oh, right.

24:58.079 --> 24:59.914
A Better Tomorrow on VHS.

25:00.540 --> 25:02.166
It's a true masterpiece. You know...

25:03.126 --> 25:06.337
In that case,
you know A Better Tomorrow...

25:06.421 --> 25:09.132
is being rereleased
for its 40th anniversary, right?

25:09.215 --> 25:10.425
Of course.

25:10.508 --> 25:12.093
Well, A Better Tomorrow is a movie that...

25:12.176 --> 25:13.761
is too much of a masterpiece

25:14.095 --> 25:16.097
to be wasted on a small screen.

25:16.180 --> 25:18.766
So maybe, since this
opportunity came up...

25:18.850 --> 25:21.477
how about seeing it in a theater?

25:22.145 --> 25:23.146
Oh...

25:24.355 --> 25:26.482
I'd love to, but...

25:26.566 --> 25:28.735
I'm not a big fan

25:28.818 --> 25:30.570
of going to the movies by myself

25:31.279 --> 25:34.449
and I don't really have anyone to go with.

25:37.243 --> 25:38.953
Oh, I see.

25:39.412 --> 25:40.788
Oh, man. What to do?

25:42.707 --> 25:44.083
Well, in that case...

25:45.168 --> 25:47.045
at the movie theater...

25:48.504 --> 25:52.133
How about doing a
"going to the movies alone" challenge?

25:52.216 --> 25:54.886
You know those "eating alone" challenges?
It's been popular since the pandemic.

25:57.346 --> 25:59.640
- By myself?
- A lot of the younger crowd does it.

25:59.724 --> 26:01.559
By myself... Sure, I guess.

26:02.393 --> 26:04.228
- A challenge?
- A challenge. Be cool about it.

26:04.312 --> 26:05.855
Yeah, why not?

26:06.230 --> 26:10.943
JUMBO24
CONVENIENCE STORE

26:21.704 --> 26:23.122
Thank... Thank you.

26:23.706 --> 26:24.874
Thanks for the ride.

26:24.957 --> 26:26.375
You should get going. You must be busy.

26:26.626 --> 26:27.794
Okay.

26:28.628 --> 26:29.879
- Excuse me, sir.
- Yes?

26:31.297 --> 26:32.924
A Better Tomorrow.

26:33.883 --> 26:35.093
When are you going to see it?

26:35.885 --> 26:37.845
It comes out the day after tomorrow

26:38.554 --> 26:39.764
- so I'm going on opening day.
- Really?

26:40.223 --> 26:41.766
- Yes.
- I happen to be

26:42.100 --> 26:43.184
off the day after tomorrow.

26:44.977 --> 26:47.230
Oh, really?

26:48.731 --> 26:52.151
Oh, do you guys work two shifts or three?
The police, I mean.

27:02.411 --> 27:04.413
- Do you want to go together?
- Go where?

27:06.958 --> 27:08.209
To the movies.

27:08.626 --> 27:09.877
A Better Tomorrow.

27:10.086 --> 27:11.379
I'm asking you to go see it with me.

27:16.467 --> 27:17.969
- You don't want to?
- No.

27:21.639 --> 27:22.640
I'd love to.

27:23.349 --> 27:25.226
Okay, I'll contact you about the time.

27:25.309 --> 27:26.310
Okay.

27:26.894 --> 27:28.437
- I'll be in touch.
- Okay.

27:43.119 --> 27:44.287
It doesn't hurt.

27:50.293 --> 27:51.502
- Come on.
- Yes, boss.

27:55.089 --> 27:57.466
Oh, are you all right? Boss, really...

27:57.800 --> 27:59.802
I have all my men searching for him.

27:59.886 --> 28:01.137
If you could just give me
a little more time...

28:01.220 --> 28:02.221
Hey, you son of a bitch.

28:02.305 --> 28:04.473
The deal our entire organization's future
depends on is the day after tomorrow

28:04.807 --> 28:05.850
and you want more time?

28:05.933 --> 28:08.227
If that Martial Arts Master shows up
and ruins the whole thing

28:08.311 --> 28:10.104
how can we go through with the deal

28:10.396 --> 28:12.148
when we don't even know
what that bastard is after?

28:13.774 --> 28:15.026
Boss, please.

28:15.359 --> 28:18.154
Wouldn't it be better
to just postpone the deal?

28:22.074 --> 28:25.036
You know how big the down payment is,
and you're still spouting that nonsense?

28:25.203 --> 28:27.371
If the deal falls through
and we end up with nothing

28:27.580 --> 28:29.540
- are you going to take responsibility?
- I'm sorry, sir.

28:29.916 --> 28:31.709
The deal is happening
no matter what. Got it?

28:31.792 --> 28:34.670
Before then, you catch that
Martial Arts Master and drag him to me.

28:34.837 --> 28:36.881
- Yes, sir.
- Drag him here!

28:36.964 --> 28:39.592
- Bring him to me!
- Yes, boss!

28:39.675 --> 28:40.760
Let's go.

28:44.388 --> 28:46.599
Damn, that hurts like hell.

28:48.434 --> 28:50.061
How long do I have to take this beating?

28:55.816 --> 28:57.401
Hey, Mr. Golden Boy.

28:59.028 --> 29:00.446
Oh, yes, Chairman. Hello.

29:01.906 --> 29:02.907
What's up, man?

29:03.282 --> 29:04.283
Why the long face?

29:04.367 --> 29:05.743
Something wrong?

29:06.452 --> 29:08.329
Oh, it's nothing.

29:08.412 --> 29:09.830
Oh, come on.

29:10.456 --> 29:11.457
Don't be like that.

29:11.540 --> 29:12.708
How about you and I...

29:12.792 --> 29:14.627
go for a drive in my supercar?

29:15.544 --> 29:16.963
With... with me?

29:17.046 --> 29:18.673
Yes. It's for you.

29:19.465 --> 29:20.466
Come on.

29:35.648 --> 29:36.774
Oh, I'm sorry.

29:37.900 --> 29:40.278
Just think of us as colleagues

29:40.361 --> 29:41.779
and let's be comfortable, okay?

29:41.862 --> 29:43.406
Here, have some coffee.

29:44.949 --> 29:46.117
Yeah, relax.

29:50.705 --> 29:52.331
Must be tough working
under President Yoo, huh?

29:52.415 --> 29:53.416
No, not at all.

29:53.499 --> 29:54.792
Oh, come on.

29:55.793 --> 29:58.129
But for all the hard work you do

29:58.212 --> 29:59.380
it seems you're not treated very well.

29:59.463 --> 30:01.132
Your face is all banged up.

30:03.968 --> 30:07.179
I mean, if it were me,
for a great ace like our Mr. Geum

30:07.263 --> 30:09.849
I could make a much better offer.

30:12.893 --> 30:16.022
I have no intention of betraying my boss.

30:19.150 --> 30:20.359
Oh, I shouldn't have said that.

30:20.443 --> 30:21.527
Hey, hey, hey.

30:21.610 --> 30:24.155
Here, wipe the side
of your mouth. The coffee.

30:26.157 --> 30:29.744
I'm not trying to talk about something
as serious as betrayal. It's just...

30:30.661 --> 30:34.290
I wanted to chat with Mr. Geum
about the struggles at work.

30:35.499 --> 30:36.917
For example

30:37.209 --> 30:40.838
like the story
of the civilian who recently

30:40.921 --> 30:42.548
laid waste to Heaven Capital.

30:42.798 --> 30:46.010
Or what President Yoo
is secretly working on.

30:46.510 --> 30:49.138
Interesting topics
like his jerky business.

30:49.555 --> 30:50.556
Okay?

30:51.015 --> 30:52.558
Chairman, how did you...

30:53.726 --> 30:54.769
Come on.

30:54.852 --> 30:56.270
There's no secret, man.

30:57.688 --> 30:58.689
Sorry?

31:00.524 --> 31:02.109
What... What did you say?

31:04.737 --> 31:07.323
I mean, there are no secrets.

31:07.865 --> 31:08.908
There are no secrets...

31:08.991 --> 31:10.868
CASHIER'S CHECK 10,000,000 WON

31:15.873 --> 31:17.833
The story our Mr. Geum told me today

31:17.917 --> 31:19.210
how should I put it...

31:19.919 --> 31:21.212
was so very moving.

31:21.420 --> 31:22.421
- Right.
- Let's...

31:22.505 --> 31:23.506
see each other again.

31:31.222 --> 31:32.973
- What do you want?
- It's a gift from the Chairman.

31:34.308 --> 31:35.351
A gift?

31:42.274 --> 31:43.484
Chairman, thank you.

31:51.700 --> 31:52.868
Oh, hello.

31:52.952 --> 31:54.078
Welcome.

31:54.161 --> 31:56.122
You must be coming
from the campaign trail.

31:56.205 --> 31:57.540
You're a little late today, aren't you?

31:57.623 --> 31:59.667
Yes, I suppose I am.

31:59.750 --> 32:01.669
Can I get a special
and a bottle of soju, please?

32:01.752 --> 32:03.587
Coming right up.

32:03.671 --> 32:04.880
Yes, goodness.

32:06.674 --> 32:07.675
Jeez.

32:17.935 --> 32:20.729
Assemblyman Han, what are you doing here?

32:20.813 --> 32:23.357
I heard rumors that this is the spot

32:23.441 --> 32:25.109
Candidate Kim frequents every day

32:25.192 --> 32:26.444
so I came to see for myself.

32:27.987 --> 32:29.029
Am I making you uncomfortable?

32:29.572 --> 32:31.699
No, no, not at all.

32:31.782 --> 32:33.576
- Please, have a seat.
- Thank you.

32:34.743 --> 32:36.954
The gukbap here is out of this world.

32:37.037 --> 32:38.205
You should try it.

32:49.842 --> 32:50.843
Here.

32:51.343 --> 32:52.386
Let me pour you a drink.

32:53.721 --> 32:55.514
- Ah, thank you.
- Here.

33:00.895 --> 33:01.896
Let me.

33:06.775 --> 33:08.611
Oh, I'm sorry.

33:09.111 --> 33:11.572
I've been campaigning,
which isn't something I'm cut out for.

33:12.948 --> 33:15.159
When I was on my first campaign trail

33:15.659 --> 33:17.036
I shook so many hands

33:17.411 --> 33:18.829
that my hands were covered in blisters.

33:19.079 --> 33:20.915
Oh, really?

33:21.373 --> 33:23.959
Shaking hands all day
until my arm felt like it would fall off

33:24.043 --> 33:26.462
smiling until my face cramped up

33:26.545 --> 33:28.714
and giving speeches
until my voice was hoarse

33:29.673 --> 33:31.425
I couldn't help
but feel a sense of regret.

33:32.593 --> 33:35.721
"Did I really run for office
just for this?"

33:37.640 --> 33:39.225
How about you, Candidate Kim?

33:39.642 --> 33:40.851
Running in this election

33:41.435 --> 33:42.645
don't you regret it?

33:44.605 --> 33:47.107
For someone who has spent
their entire life as an educator

33:48.400 --> 33:50.486
playing the part of a politician
that doesn't suit you

33:51.111 --> 33:52.780
must be incredibly difficult.

33:53.864 --> 33:54.865
What if...

33:55.491 --> 33:57.451
the things you want to accomplish

33:58.077 --> 34:00.287
could be achieved
without you becoming mayor?

34:00.913 --> 34:03.290
Would you still continue
with the election?

34:09.088 --> 34:11.090
What are you trying to say?

34:26.188 --> 34:27.231
YEONGSEON ISLAND ORPHANAGE
SUPPORT PROJECT PROPOSAL

34:31.610 --> 34:33.821
COMMUNITY NETWORK, DEVELOPMENT AND
MANAGEMENT OF LOCAL RESOURCES...

34:37.199 --> 34:38.492
If you withdraw from the race...

34:39.660 --> 34:41.161
the orphanage on Yeongseon Island

34:41.245 --> 34:42.997
that you care so deeply about...

34:43.080 --> 34:44.373
the children there will also benefit.

34:45.124 --> 34:46.792
I hear their donations are so meager

34:46.875 --> 34:49.211
they can't even fix
the heating and cooling.

34:49.920 --> 34:52.381
But we could easily
build them a new building.

34:52.923 --> 34:54.592
Besides housing, we're also considering
a plan for scholarships.

34:55.259 --> 34:57.595
To allow the children to pursue the
education they want

34:57.678 --> 34:59.638
we are looking into ways
to provide support.

35:04.518 --> 35:05.936
I'm sorry

35:06.228 --> 35:07.896
but I'm going to pretend this
conversation never happened.

35:08.480 --> 35:10.691
I can't support the children

35:10.899 --> 35:12.735
with money from a questionable source.

35:14.653 --> 35:15.654
Source?

35:18.782 --> 35:20.951
Money is money.

35:21.035 --> 35:23.454
Even if you pour
your entire salary into it

35:23.871 --> 35:25.331
and volunteer every day...

35:26.540 --> 35:27.916
do you think you could accomplish

35:28.292 --> 35:30.044
even one thing on this plan?

35:30.919 --> 35:32.963
You said you'd make Yeongseon Island
a place for children.

35:33.714 --> 35:34.923
Were those all just empty words?

35:48.062 --> 35:49.772
You asked me

35:49.855 --> 35:52.316
if I regretted running for office.

35:53.400 --> 35:54.401
Yes.

35:55.027 --> 35:56.445
It's a struggle every day.

35:57.363 --> 35:59.406
Every day, I want to run away.

36:01.033 --> 36:03.619
For someone like me
who's only ever been a teacher

36:04.453 --> 36:08.040
politics doesn't seem to be my calling.

36:08.707 --> 36:09.708
But...

36:10.000 --> 36:11.460
what's even scarier...

36:13.253 --> 36:15.381
is the thought of Assemblyman Han
becoming mayor

36:16.173 --> 36:19.760
ruining the island
and the children's futures

36:20.928 --> 36:22.388
and me just turning a blind eye to it.

36:29.812 --> 36:32.272
It seems this will be the last drink...

36:33.357 --> 36:34.692
we'll have together.

36:36.652 --> 36:38.654
Then order anything you'd like.

36:38.737 --> 36:39.738
Since it's our last

36:39.822 --> 36:40.948
it's on me.

36:41.323 --> 36:42.324
That's all right.

36:44.743 --> 36:45.744
CASHIER'S CHECK 100,000 WON

36:45.828 --> 36:47.162
I've had more than enough.

36:47.621 --> 36:48.622
Well, then.

36:55.879 --> 36:57.798
YEONGSEON ISLAND ORPHANAGE
SUPPORT PROJECT PROPOSAL

37:09.935 --> 37:10.936
Hey, Joong-gi.

37:13.981 --> 37:15.315
It looks like I'll have to go do

37:16.567 --> 37:17.985
some volunteer work at the orphanage soon.

37:28.370 --> 37:30.080
If I go to Yeongseon Island now

37:30.831 --> 37:32.249
it'll mess up the whole plan.

37:38.338 --> 37:40.215
What are you talking about, Boss?

37:40.299 --> 37:42.760
Some prosecutor came for a visit.

37:43.427 --> 37:45.888
At first, I didn't know
what to make of it.

37:46.388 --> 37:49.933
Who knew she'd be some hard-ass
so fixated on that case?

37:54.646 --> 37:55.647
Beom-ryong.

37:55.731 --> 37:57.524
You need to go meet this Prosecutor Gang

37:58.025 --> 37:59.109
right away.

38:01.236 --> 38:03.447
Wait, are you telling me
to help a prosecutor?

38:03.530 --> 38:05.073
You think I enjoy working

38:05.157 --> 38:06.408
with some low-life prosecutor?

38:06.784 --> 38:08.076
Hey, but if it means

38:08.160 --> 38:09.244
I can clear my name

38:09.328 --> 38:11.830
and take down
that traitor bastard Yoo In-gu

38:12.289 --> 38:14.291
I suppose I can learn to love my enemy.

38:14.833 --> 38:17.628
I've already laid out the bait

38:17.836 --> 38:20.672
so Prosecutor Gang
is sure to approach Yoo In-gu.

38:21.173 --> 38:23.759
I need you to be proactive

38:24.259 --> 38:25.260
and help her.

38:25.594 --> 38:29.223
And start wrapping up your business.

38:29.932 --> 38:31.183
My... my business?

38:31.266 --> 38:32.810
But this could be our last chance.

38:32.893 --> 38:34.770
We have to risk our lives and go all in.

38:35.187 --> 38:36.605
We have to start gathering the boys

38:36.688 --> 38:38.649
and supporting this Prosecutor Gang.

38:38.774 --> 38:40.651
Do you think you'll have time
to run a business?

38:42.361 --> 38:43.362
Why?

38:43.445 --> 38:44.613
Is something holding you back?

39:10.347 --> 39:12.391
MASKED RACER LIVE ACTION PLAY
MASKED RACER'S GREAT ADVENTURE

39:13.267 --> 39:14.685
- What's this?
- You know...

39:14.768 --> 39:16.520
Ji-woo loves Masked Racer.

39:16.979 --> 39:18.522
They're putting on a show
at the Arts Center.

39:20.274 --> 39:21.942
What about the dinner service tomorrow?

39:23.944 --> 39:25.320
After Ji-woo was born

39:25.404 --> 39:28.615
we've been so busy,
we haven't had a proper outing.

39:28.699 --> 39:30.617
Let the three of us go,
get some fresh air for a change.

39:32.452 --> 39:33.662
Just go.

39:34.371 --> 39:36.415
Is it going to kill us to close
for a day or two?

39:36.623 --> 39:39.251
We can just close after the lunch service.

39:39.334 --> 39:40.460
Dad, even if we close
for one service, our sales...

39:40.586 --> 39:42.212
Forget about the sales!

39:42.713 --> 39:44.464
Do I have to walk on eggshells
running this place

39:44.548 --> 39:46.174
wondering if you two are fighting?

39:46.884 --> 39:49.094
Please, just go out and settle it already

39:49.177 --> 39:50.596
one way or another.

39:51.597 --> 39:55.267
Dad, it's not like
I was making things tense.

39:57.311 --> 39:59.313
All right, fine. We're going, okay?

39:59.897 --> 40:01.732
This is Ji-woo's favorite.

40:07.696 --> 40:09.615
Assemblyman Han, step down!

40:09.698 --> 40:12.993
- Step down! Step down!
- Step down! Step down!

40:13.076 --> 40:14.828
Chairman Do, step down!

40:14.912 --> 40:16.955
- Step down! Step down!
- Step down! Step down!

40:17.039 --> 40:18.415
- Step down!
- Step down!

40:41.021 --> 40:43.774
Oh, this is going to get ugly.

40:58.121 --> 40:59.247
Yes, this is Gang Yeong-ae.

40:59.331 --> 41:01.166
Going into the hotel right now...

41:01.500 --> 41:03.126
I suggest you think twice about it.

41:05.087 --> 41:06.380
Who are you, really?

41:14.054 --> 41:15.263
Are you stalking me?

41:15.347 --> 41:18.600
I'm not stalking you.
I'm trying to warn you. It's dangerous.

41:18.684 --> 41:21.353
Okay, so who are you
to keep giving me these warnings?

41:21.436 --> 41:23.855
- What, are we in a spy movie?
- Prosecutor Gang.

41:24.314 --> 41:27.067
I helped you lose the detective
that was tailing you.

41:27.150 --> 41:28.360
Don't you remember?

41:28.443 --> 41:30.529
- Just trust me.
- Okay.

41:32.572 --> 41:34.992
If you really want me to trust you,
come down to the prosecutor's office.

41:35.075 --> 41:36.743
I'll run a nice, thorough
background check on you

41:36.827 --> 41:39.454
and if you check out,
then I'll believe you.

41:42.416 --> 41:43.917
Go home now.

41:56.096 --> 41:57.097
Right.

41:57.431 --> 41:59.558
I'll think about it while I eat.

42:04.563 --> 42:06.064
You can eat at a time like this?

42:06.148 --> 42:07.357
Manager Lee, you're here.

42:07.441 --> 42:09.234
- Want an egg?
- No, I'm fine.

42:09.735 --> 42:12.195
I brought as much of the stuff
the boss told me to throw out as I could.

42:17.868 --> 42:19.119
This is all you could grab?

42:19.786 --> 42:21.371
You could've tried harder.

42:21.455 --> 42:23.373
Thanks. Thank you.

42:23.457 --> 42:24.583
When I go back to work

42:24.666 --> 42:27.419
I'll cover all your tasks. Thank you.

42:28.628 --> 42:30.005
I don't think that's going to happen.

42:32.049 --> 42:33.050
Manager Bong.

42:33.425 --> 42:36.053
Your employment was terminated,
effective today.

42:39.681 --> 42:41.099
No. I...

42:41.433 --> 42:43.185
Fired? But why?

42:43.268 --> 42:44.436
You really don't know?

42:45.395 --> 42:47.314
You constantly missed work

42:47.397 --> 42:49.316
you were secretly living at the office

42:49.399 --> 42:51.610
and you brought thugs
who wrecked the boss's car.

42:51.693 --> 42:53.570
The boss was about to
call the police on you

42:53.653 --> 42:55.280
for trespassing and a hit-and-run.

42:55.363 --> 42:57.908
I barely convinced him
not to press charges

42:57.991 --> 42:59.743
by agreeing to fire you
and deduct it from your severance.

42:59.826 --> 43:00.827
So...

43:04.206 --> 43:06.083
So, try not to feel like
this is too unfair.

43:07.000 --> 43:09.002
What? Uncle, you got fired?

43:09.836 --> 43:11.713
So are we completely broke now? Huh?

43:15.425 --> 43:17.344
Do you have anywhere to go?

43:17.803 --> 43:18.804
Does it look like it?

43:19.471 --> 43:21.848
There are thugs outside looking for us.

43:26.436 --> 43:27.437
Manager Bong.

43:27.896 --> 43:30.190
Do you just need a place
that provides room and board?

43:32.859 --> 43:35.946
I mean, I know a job
that provides room and board

43:36.029 --> 43:38.532
that I could introduce you to.

43:38.615 --> 43:40.325
But I'm not sure if you'd be good at it...

43:40.408 --> 43:42.786
I'll do it. Yeah, I'll definitely do it.

43:42.869 --> 43:44.371
I'll be great at it, no matter what.

43:44.746 --> 43:46.331
Cleaning, washing cars?

43:46.498 --> 43:47.666
What is it?

43:56.299 --> 43:58.468
D-DAY

44:03.098 --> 44:04.516
Excuse me.

44:05.267 --> 44:06.351
How can I help you?

44:08.270 --> 44:10.814
I'm Prosecutor Gang Yeong-ae
from Imcheon District Prosecutors' Office.

44:10.897 --> 44:12.107
I'm here to see the president...

44:13.692 --> 44:14.693
Oh, my.

44:14.818 --> 44:17.404
You're Mr. Yoo In-gu, aren't you?

44:23.535 --> 44:26.788
A prosecutor, visiting a clean
and legitimate business like ours...

44:27.164 --> 44:28.540
what could possibly bring you here?

44:28.623 --> 44:30.709
Well, I...

44:31.084 --> 44:33.378
I'm currently investigating a case.

44:34.588 --> 44:36.006
And I have a few questions for you.

44:36.089 --> 44:37.299
Yes, of course.

44:43.597 --> 44:45.807
Do you happen to know anything

44:45.891 --> 44:48.351
about the Passenger Ship Spy Case
from ten years ago?

44:48.810 --> 44:49.978
That's the first I'm hearing of it.

44:50.061 --> 44:51.146
A spy came down here?

44:53.648 --> 44:54.649
Then...

44:55.233 --> 44:56.234
what about this?

44:56.610 --> 44:58.195
The case where your former boss,
Hwang Hwa-san

44:58.278 --> 45:00.071
murdered Kwon Soon-bok.

45:01.740 --> 45:03.992
Well, now. My memory's
a bit fuzzy on that.

45:04.075 --> 45:06.620
Didn't you take over the Hwasan Sect
and establish the Ingu Sect after that?

45:06.745 --> 45:07.746
Oh, I didn't take it over.

45:07.829 --> 45:08.997
I branched off on my own.

45:09.789 --> 45:11.666
And I don't know what these were about

45:11.750 --> 45:13.335
but what a tragedy.

45:13.418 --> 45:16.588
I don't really follow the news,
so I don't know much

45:17.088 --> 45:19.049
so I'm not sure how helpful
my answers can be.

45:19.883 --> 45:21.092
Shall we continue, though?

45:22.886 --> 45:25.430
Then I'll just ask you one last thing.

45:37.150 --> 45:38.318
You know who this is, right?

45:38.860 --> 45:40.320
Well, he's...

45:40.737 --> 45:42.989
Isn't he the one running for mayor?

45:43.448 --> 45:46.201
You don't watch the news, but you seem to
know Han Gyeong-wook quite well.

45:46.326 --> 45:47.911
I've just seen his campaign posters

45:47.994 --> 45:49.579
a few times.

45:50.121 --> 45:51.623
Let's be honest.

45:53.333 --> 45:55.001
These previous cases

45:55.085 --> 45:57.045
and Han Gyeong-wook...

45:57.462 --> 45:58.630
You know all about them, don't you?

45:58.713 --> 46:00.757
What, are you interrogating me now?

46:00.840 --> 46:02.342
Interrogating you? Me?

46:02.425 --> 46:04.010
I'm just asking you questions.

46:05.595 --> 46:07.013
Right, okay.

46:07.097 --> 46:08.556
In any case, as for the details...

46:08.723 --> 46:12.185
I'll hear them when I visit Han
Gyeong-wook in person.

46:12.394 --> 46:14.271
Wait, you're going to visit him in person?

46:15.105 --> 46:16.147
Oh, why?

46:16.231 --> 46:18.566
I mean, it's not like you know him.

46:19.150 --> 46:21.152
- So it shouldn't be a problem, right?
- Right. It's no problem.

46:24.698 --> 46:25.699
I see.

46:27.284 --> 46:28.493
Okay, got it.

46:29.077 --> 46:31.913
Well, thank you so much
for your cooperation.

46:31.997 --> 46:33.415
- Of course.
- Yes.

46:34.499 --> 46:36.209
Still, if by any chance...

46:36.293 --> 46:38.420
you remember anything...

46:38.628 --> 46:39.796
IMCHEON DISTRICT PROSECUTORS' OFFICE
PROSECUTOR GANG YEONG-AE

46:40.505 --> 46:42.090
- Please give me a call.
- Sure.

46:42.173 --> 46:44.259
- Well, I'll be on my way.
- Yes, take care.

46:44.342 --> 46:45.802
- Goodbye.
- Bye.

46:54.602 --> 46:57.397
"He's a stranger."

46:58.148 --> 46:59.316
What a joke.

47:00.483 --> 47:02.027
IMCHEON DISTRICT PROSECUTORS' OFFICE
PROSECUTOR GANG YEONG-AE

47:05.405 --> 47:06.406
Boss.

47:08.867 --> 47:10.118
Is she really a prosecutor?

47:10.201 --> 47:12.037
Why the hell is a prosecutor
showing up now, of all times?

47:14.581 --> 47:15.790
Hey, this is no time
to be standing around.

47:16.124 --> 47:19.210
- Have her tailed and report back to me.
- Yes, sir.

48:00.126 --> 48:01.127
TWO UNREAD MESSAGES

48:01.211 --> 48:02.504
OFFICER PARK MI-KYUNG
SEE YOU TOMORROW THEN!

48:02.587 --> 48:04.631
YOUR BOOKING IS COMPLETE
A BETTER TOMORROW

48:08.968 --> 48:10.345
A prosecutor from the Criminal Division
came to see him?

48:10.428 --> 48:11.429
Yes.

48:12.180 --> 48:15.016
I mean, everything the Ingu Sect
has ever done

48:15.100 --> 48:16.559
she just threw it all in the boss's face.

48:16.643 --> 48:18.144
As if she already knew everything.

48:20.105 --> 48:21.689
And on top of that, the real kicker was...

48:22.273 --> 48:24.067
she kept pressing him asking if he was

48:24.150 --> 48:25.151
connected to Chief Han.

48:25.235 --> 48:27.987
- Who? Chief Han?
- Yes.

48:29.322 --> 48:30.907
He was already worried
about Heaven Capital

48:30.990 --> 48:33.118
and terrified that
Chief Han would find out.

48:33.660 --> 48:36.037
And then a prosecutor
shows up out of the blue.

48:37.414 --> 48:39.457
In-gu is pretty much
losing his mind right now.

48:39.541 --> 48:40.792
He's so cornered

48:40.875 --> 48:42.502
he's ready to snap at
anyone who gets near him.

48:42.919 --> 48:44.003
Damn.

48:45.171 --> 48:47.549
This President Yoo is becoming
more and more of a problem.

48:48.550 --> 48:50.552
So, is President Yoo
just going to stand by

48:50.635 --> 48:52.011
and do nothing about that prosecutor?

48:53.930 --> 48:56.349
Come on, no matter how reckless the boss
gets

48:56.433 --> 48:58.309
you don't think he'd actually do
something to a prosecutor?

48:58.435 --> 49:01.312
I mean, you mess with one
and your life is over in a flash.

49:03.982 --> 49:05.024
Right?

49:05.525 --> 49:08.027
Mess with a prosecutor
and you're completely screwed.

49:17.787 --> 49:18.788
Yo!

49:19.998 --> 49:23.168
What the hell are you doing here
so early in the morning?

49:23.877 --> 49:25.420
There was something
I needed to check on urgently.

49:27.046 --> 49:29.799
It looks like a critical problem has come
up with Heaven Capital.

49:29.924 --> 49:32.927
- What's this punk up to now?
- A prosecutor...

49:33.803 --> 49:34.804
paid a visit.

49:35.430 --> 49:37.140
Looks like she got a whiff of what the
Ingu Sect's been doing

49:37.599 --> 49:38.933
and came sniffing around.

49:39.017 --> 49:40.143
How the hell would you know that?

49:40.226 --> 49:42.395
Because she came to me
and asked a bunch of questions.

49:42.479 --> 49:44.355
I played dumb
and said I didn't know anything

49:44.439 --> 49:45.857
but it was a tough spot to be in.

49:46.858 --> 49:48.776
I mean, now that a prosecutor's involved

49:48.860 --> 49:50.487
I can't just let this slide
without reporting

49:50.570 --> 49:51.863
such a serious matter to Chief Han.

49:51.946 --> 49:54.115
You son of a bitch,
are you going to snitch to Chief Han?

49:56.534 --> 49:57.577
What did you just call me?

50:00.914 --> 50:01.915
Hey.

50:01.998 --> 50:02.999
Yoo In-gu.

50:03.541 --> 50:06.252
You think I'm a pushover
just because I'm being nice?

50:07.045 --> 50:08.046
Do you?

50:08.880 --> 50:10.965
How dare you threaten me?

50:12.091 --> 50:13.760
Do you still not get it?

50:15.178 --> 50:16.221
What are you talking about?

50:16.763 --> 50:18.681
A prosecutor showed up! A prosecutor.

50:18.765 --> 50:20.141
Don't you know what that means?

50:21.142 --> 50:24.938
If she starts poking around Yeongseon
Island and blows our operation

50:25.021 --> 50:27.232
do you think Chief Han, with his temper,
will just stand by and watch?

50:27.315 --> 50:30.318
You, who caused this mess,
and me, who looked the other way...

50:31.611 --> 50:33.863
we'll both be killed without a trace.

50:34.614 --> 50:35.615
Got it?

50:36.908 --> 50:38.618
No, no.

50:38.701 --> 50:39.994
What was I thinking?

50:40.078 --> 50:42.539
Look, I'm sorry for getting angry.

50:42.705 --> 50:45.083
This is not good.
Before I get dragged down into this mess

50:45.166 --> 50:47.252
I think the right thing to do
is report this to Chief Han.

50:47.335 --> 50:49.504
- Chairman Do...
- Let go of me! Don't touch me.

50:49.587 --> 50:50.922
I didn't touch you!

50:51.005 --> 50:52.465
Come on, don't be like this.

50:52.549 --> 50:54.259
That prosecutor...

50:54.634 --> 50:56.928
I'll take care of her.
Just give me some time.

50:57.679 --> 51:01.516
What are you going to do if I give you
time? That's ridiculous.

51:01.599 --> 51:03.601
I have a way! I have a plan.

51:03.810 --> 51:04.811
I do.

51:04.894 --> 51:06.437
You said you trusted my abilities,
didn't you? Huh?

51:08.273 --> 51:09.440
You said we're in the same boat.

51:10.858 --> 51:13.152
Just give me some time,
and I'll handle it myself. I swear.

51:15.697 --> 51:17.031
Jesus Christ.

51:20.660 --> 51:21.744
You have one day.

51:21.828 --> 51:23.288
If you can't fix this by tomorrow

51:23.371 --> 51:26.332
then there's really nothing
I can do for you. Okay?

51:26.416 --> 51:28.668
- One day?
- One day. Yeah?

51:30.378 --> 51:32.297
Mr. Yoo. Don't keep...

51:32.964 --> 51:35.717
- making me be the bad guy. All right?
- Okay.

51:37.135 --> 51:38.928
- By tomorrow.
- Yeah, I got it.

51:48.396 --> 51:50.648
CLOSED FOR DINNER TONIGHT

51:50.982 --> 51:52.859
Ji-woo, what's this one's name?

51:53.151 --> 51:56.070
- Masked Racer.
- Oh, Masked Racer.

51:57.238 --> 51:58.906
Okay, then what about this guy?

51:59.574 --> 52:00.575
A monster.

52:02.076 --> 52:05.288
Gosh, you're a sharp judge of character.

52:08.041 --> 52:09.042
Mom.

52:29.604 --> 52:31.356
O-ran, you look amazing!

52:31.773 --> 52:33.232
Well, she takes after me

52:33.316 --> 52:36.069
so of course she's a knockout.
You know it.

52:37.070 --> 52:39.530
Mom, you look really pretty today.

52:42.075 --> 52:43.826
I just put on what I usually wear.

52:44.577 --> 52:45.995
Should I change if it's too much?

52:46.079 --> 52:47.538
No, it looks great on you.

52:48.122 --> 52:49.374
After the play

52:49.457 --> 52:50.708
let's go eat somewhere nice.

52:50.792 --> 52:51.918
I've already found a place.

52:53.002 --> 52:54.003
Let's go.

52:54.379 --> 52:56.172
- Ji-woo, let's go.
- Okay, have fun, sweetie.

52:56.255 --> 52:57.423
Let's go!

52:58.049 --> 52:59.425
- We'll get going.
- All right.

52:59.509 --> 53:01.511
- Have fun.
- We're off!

54:10.955 --> 54:14.041
IMCHEON DISTRICT PROSECUTORS' OFFICE
PROSECUTOR GANG YEONG-AE

54:20.214 --> 54:22.467
- Hello?
- Prosecutor Gang Yeong-ae.

54:23.092 --> 54:24.469
Yes, speaking. Who is this?

54:24.552 --> 54:26.721
I used to serve Chairman Hwang Hwa-san.

54:26.888 --> 54:28.055
My name is Gang Beom-ryong.

54:28.848 --> 54:32.185
I was told you'd clear
our chairman's name.

54:33.186 --> 54:34.395
As much as I can

54:34.812 --> 54:36.022
I want to help you with that.

54:37.482 --> 54:38.733
Why should I...

54:38.816 --> 54:40.735
trust you, Mr. Gang Beom-ryong?

54:40.818 --> 54:41.986
Ten years ago...

54:42.570 --> 54:44.030
The Passenger Ship Spy Case.

54:45.573 --> 54:47.033
I was on that passenger ship.

54:47.533 --> 54:50.536
I know all the details of the case
you're interested in.

54:51.329 --> 54:53.122
You really know everything?

54:53.206 --> 54:55.249
I'd like to meet you
in person to tell you.

54:55.541 --> 54:56.918
Where are you right now, by any chance?

54:59.378 --> 55:01.506
- On Yeongseon Island.
- Yeongseon Island?

55:01.589 --> 55:03.216
Wait, Yoo In-gu...

55:05.551 --> 55:07.929
Have you already met Yoo In-gu?

55:08.137 --> 55:10.264
Yes, but it wasn't very fruitful.

55:10.348 --> 55:12.850
Let's meet somewhere quiet.

55:13.643 --> 55:15.019
I'll decide on the place.

55:19.106 --> 55:21.400
HAN GYEONG-WOOK! THE EXPERT FOR IMCHEON'S
CULTURE AND INDUSTRY

55:30.201 --> 55:31.869
- What brings you here?
- Well...

55:32.036 --> 55:34.163
I was hoping I could borrow some money.

55:34.872 --> 55:36.541
- Have a seat.
- Oh, okay.

55:48.511 --> 55:50.888
IOU LOAN AMOUNT 50,000 WON

55:51.681 --> 55:52.682
- Sir.
- Yes?

55:52.765 --> 55:54.684
- You wrote this part wrong.
- No, I didn't write it wrong.

55:54.767 --> 55:57.520
- No, I'm telling you, this is wrong.
- No, I didn't write it wrong.

55:59.605 --> 56:00.982
- Fifty thousand won?
- Yes, fifty thousand won.

56:01.482 --> 56:02.567
Fifty thousand won?

56:02.650 --> 56:05.111
Yes, fifty thousand won.
I'm on a roll right now, sir.

56:05.194 --> 56:07.196
So if I just pull the lever now,
I'll hit the jackpot.

56:07.280 --> 56:08.364
- Get out.
- No, sir.

56:08.447 --> 56:10.575
- I said, get out.
- No. I really need this. I...

56:10.658 --> 56:12.201
- Hey, guys! Hey!
- Jackpot.

56:12.285 --> 56:13.619
- Hey, get him out of here! Now!
- I'm about to hit the jackpot!

56:13.703 --> 56:15.538
I swear, my time has come!

56:15.621 --> 56:17.748
- Are you kidding me? Damn.
- No, I...

56:17.832 --> 56:18.916
Hey.

56:19.000 --> 56:21.002
- Just 50,000 won.
- Knock some sense into him. Seriously.

56:21.085 --> 56:22.795
Just 50,000 won. I'm telling you.

56:22.879 --> 56:25.464
I'm on a roll! Just 50,000 won!

56:37.018 --> 56:38.019
Boss.

56:38.102 --> 56:39.103
What should we do?

56:40.730 --> 56:42.064
Where's the prosecutor?

56:43.566 --> 56:45.526
She's snooping around Yeongseon Island

56:45.610 --> 56:47.528
digging into Heaven Capital.

56:49.280 --> 56:50.823
Boss, you shouldn't.

56:51.449 --> 56:52.450
Let's postpone

56:52.909 --> 56:54.076
the drug deal.

56:55.870 --> 56:58.664
Do you have any idea how hard it was to
get this supplier?

56:58.998 --> 57:01.125
I put all of the Ingu Sect's
money into this.

57:01.709 --> 57:03.377
If this deal falls through,
we're bankrupt.

57:03.461 --> 57:04.921
But what if...

57:05.004 --> 57:07.715
What if that prosecutor bitch
gets a whiff of the drugs?

57:07.798 --> 57:10.676
What if things go wrong
and Chief Han finds out?

57:12.261 --> 57:14.430
This is on a whole different level
than the Martial Arts Master problem.

57:14.555 --> 57:16.098
There's no going back from this, Boss.

57:17.224 --> 57:18.434
Either way...

57:19.018 --> 57:21.687
If the deal falls through,
the Chinese won't let it slide.

57:22.021 --> 57:24.273
And if we don't deal
with the prosecutor by today

57:24.357 --> 57:27.318
that fox Chairman Do
will tattle to Chief Han.

57:27.610 --> 57:30.655
Whether we die because the deal is off,
or at the hands of Chief Han

57:30.947 --> 57:32.365
we die either way.

57:32.448 --> 57:34.492
Jeez, then what do we do?

57:35.034 --> 57:36.535
No matter how I think about it

57:36.911 --> 57:38.245
there's only one way to survive.

57:43.000 --> 57:44.001
The prosecutor...

57:45.211 --> 57:46.879
- Let's take her out.
- What?

57:48.673 --> 57:49.840
Boss.

57:50.424 --> 57:52.718
Going after a prosecutor
will blow this whole thing up.

57:52.802 --> 57:55.221
We can dump her in the ocean
without a soul knowing.

57:55.471 --> 57:57.932
We can bribe the Yeongseon Island cops
to erase any trace.

57:58.015 --> 58:00.309
- But still...
- If the prosecutor disappears

58:00.726 --> 58:01.727
everything's clean.

58:01.978 --> 58:03.980
We can deal with
the Martial Arts Master after that.

58:04.063 --> 58:05.439
Damn it.

58:05.564 --> 58:06.857
Kang-sik, you stop yapping

58:06.941 --> 58:08.526
and get some of your best guys ready.

58:08.943 --> 58:10.987
When the time is right, we'll do the job.

58:11.278 --> 58:13.739
Damn it, I knew this was going
to cause trouble.

58:18.703 --> 58:21.247
RESTRICTED NUMBER

58:24.041 --> 58:25.084
RESTRICTED NUMBER

58:56.240 --> 59:03.039
HILLSIDE CAFE

59:19.764 --> 59:21.682
Yes. I've arrived.

59:22.141 --> 59:24.018
She just went into
the Hillside Cafe in Nakwon-ri.

59:24.101 --> 59:25.436
Hill... Hillside Cafe?

59:25.561 --> 59:26.937
Hillside Cafe.

59:28.064 --> 59:29.815
HILLSIDE CAFE

59:30.900 --> 59:31.901
Twenty minutes.

59:43.204 --> 59:44.622
Answer the phone.

59:46.290 --> 59:47.917
This is driving me crazy.

59:48.000 --> 59:49.418
Why isn't she answering?

59:51.462 --> 59:53.589
Answer the phone... Damn it.

01:00:00.596 --> 01:00:03.099
The number you have dialed is unavailable.
Please leave a message...

01:00:42.388 --> 01:00:44.390
This is driving me crazy.

01:00:57.945 --> 01:01:00.156
Taxi!

01:01:00.531 --> 01:01:01.740
Hey!

01:01:13.752 --> 01:01:15.045
Oh, look. We're next.

01:01:15.129 --> 01:01:16.922
MASKED RACER

01:01:17.506 --> 01:01:18.966
Hey, want to take one with Mom?

01:01:19.091 --> 01:01:21.135
Come on, what is with you?

01:01:21.260 --> 01:01:22.261
Ji-woo, what pose should we do?

01:01:22.344 --> 01:01:24.180
I'll, um... I'll do this.

01:01:24.263 --> 01:01:25.764
All right, let's go.

01:01:26.265 --> 01:01:28.142
Hey, I'm gonna run to the restroom.

01:01:28.225 --> 01:01:29.351
- Okay, go ahead.
- I'll be back.

01:01:29.435 --> 01:01:30.603
Let's go, Ji-woo.

01:01:31.061 --> 01:01:33.480
MASKED RACER

01:01:34.023 --> 01:01:35.399
Ready to strike a pose, buddy?

01:01:35.482 --> 01:01:37.776
- Like this?
- Wow, you're a natural.

01:01:38.903 --> 01:01:41.071
Okay, one, two, three.

01:01:43.157 --> 01:01:44.700
RESTRICTED NUMBER

01:01:48.287 --> 01:01:49.455
Want to take one more, buddy?

01:01:49.538 --> 01:01:51.207
Sorry about that. I messed up the shot.

01:01:52.374 --> 01:01:54.335
Why are you calling?
And from a regular phone?

01:01:54.418 --> 01:01:57.004
Ho-myeong, it's an emergency.
Get over here now.

01:01:57.087 --> 01:01:58.672
What are you talking about?
Damn it, I can't.

01:01:58.756 --> 01:02:00.174
I'm with my family at a show.

01:02:00.257 --> 01:02:01.675
Listen, Yoo In-gu's crew

01:02:01.759 --> 01:02:04.178
is going to take out Prosecutor Gang.

01:02:04.428 --> 01:02:05.429
What did you say?

01:02:06.013 --> 01:02:07.932
- Where are you right now?
- I'm on Yeongseon Island.

01:02:08.057 --> 01:02:09.934
Prosecutor Gang
is on Yeongseon Island now?

01:02:10.017 --> 01:02:11.018
Yeah.

01:02:11.435 --> 01:02:13.020
Prosecutor Gang...

01:02:13.103 --> 01:02:16.023
provoked Yoo In-gu,
and now that crazy bastard...

01:02:16.690 --> 01:02:19.610
Look, I don't have time to explain.
Just get over here. Hurry!

01:02:20.861 --> 01:02:21.946
This is driving me crazy, damn it.

01:02:22.029 --> 01:02:24.490
If you don't come,
Prosecutor Gang is going to die, man.

01:02:27.660 --> 01:02:28.869
But what's wrong with your voice?

01:02:28.953 --> 01:02:30.412
It's nothing. I'm fine.

01:02:30.496 --> 01:02:32.373
I'm just a little hurt. Now, hurry up.

01:02:33.249 --> 01:02:35.501
If Prosecutor Gang goes down,
it's all over.

01:02:36.043 --> 01:02:37.461
Ho-myeong, get here fast.

01:02:41.632 --> 01:02:43.008
All right. I'll call you back.

01:02:47.096 --> 01:02:48.097
Dad.

01:02:49.473 --> 01:02:51.267
Do you have to go save the day?

01:02:54.561 --> 01:02:56.772
Masked Racer always has to...

01:02:56.981 --> 01:03:00.109
leave right when he's having fun.

01:03:03.570 --> 01:03:06.991
But you're going off
to fight the bad guys.

01:03:07.074 --> 01:03:08.284
So I'm okay.

01:03:13.580 --> 01:03:14.748
Ji-woo.

01:03:18.460 --> 01:03:20.504
The show will be starting shortly.

01:03:20.587 --> 01:03:21.672
It's starting. Let's go.

01:03:21.755 --> 01:03:24.675
We ask all audience members
to please enter the theater.

01:03:33.017 --> 01:03:34.435
Hey, listen.

01:03:35.227 --> 01:03:36.228
Well...

01:03:36.979 --> 01:03:38.230
About the show...

01:03:39.189 --> 01:03:40.190
Do you...

01:03:41.317 --> 01:03:42.318
Do you think

01:03:42.401 --> 01:03:44.695
- you could watch without me for a bit?
- What?

01:03:46.196 --> 01:03:48.115
- What are you talking about?
- It's just...

01:03:48.907 --> 01:03:51.160
something urgent came up.
I have to go take care of it.

01:03:53.662 --> 01:03:56.373
What is it? Did the shop catch on fire?

01:03:56.707 --> 01:03:58.250
What could be so urgent?

01:03:58.334 --> 01:03:59.626
I'll explain when I get back.

01:03:59.835 --> 01:04:01.211
I'm sorry. It's a real emergency.

01:04:01.295 --> 01:04:04.131
So you can't even tell me what it is

01:04:05.132 --> 01:04:06.675
but you have to leave for this emergency?

01:04:06.759 --> 01:04:07.760
Mom.

01:04:07.843 --> 01:04:09.511
I'm okay if we just watch it together.

01:04:12.848 --> 01:04:14.975
Go save the day!

01:04:16.185 --> 01:04:18.562
- I can't believe you.
- Mom, the show's starting.

01:04:18.896 --> 01:04:19.980
Let's go watch.

01:04:20.522 --> 01:04:21.523
Dad, go on.

01:04:21.774 --> 01:04:23.692
I'm going to go watch the show with Mom.

01:04:23.776 --> 01:04:26.820
Ji-woo, let me just
talk to your dad for a second.

01:04:27.696 --> 01:04:28.822
I'm so sorry.

01:04:28.947 --> 01:04:30.491
O-ran. Ji-woo.

01:04:30.741 --> 01:04:32.368
I'll be back...

01:04:32.618 --> 01:04:33.911
really soon.

01:04:34.119 --> 01:04:35.579
Hey, wait.

01:04:35.662 --> 01:04:36.872
Mom.

01:04:38.332 --> 01:04:39.416
Wait...

01:04:51.220 --> 01:04:54.014
HILLSIDE CAFE

01:05:02.314 --> 01:05:03.357
Excuse me.

01:05:03.857 --> 01:05:05.317
What happened here?

01:05:05.692 --> 01:05:06.860
Don't even ask.

01:05:07.069 --> 01:05:08.195
A while ago

01:05:08.278 --> 01:05:09.696
some thugs stormed in here

01:05:09.780 --> 01:05:11.782
trying to get a woman.

01:05:12.032 --> 01:05:13.909
They totally wrecked the place.

01:05:14.410 --> 01:05:15.661
Damn it.

01:05:17.538 --> 01:05:18.997
Where did they all go?

01:05:19.123 --> 01:05:20.124
I don't know.

01:05:20.416 --> 01:05:21.875
They just sped off in a car.

01:05:22.251 --> 01:05:23.252
Which way did they go?

01:05:23.335 --> 01:05:24.670
They headed toward the main road.

01:05:29.091 --> 01:05:30.134
Thank you.

01:05:59.913 --> 01:06:02.875
SPECIAL THANKS TO OUR GUEST STARS
KIM SANG-KYUNG, KWON YUL, AND PARK JI-HWAN

01:06:17.389 --> 01:06:18.390
Let's go together.

01:06:18.474 --> 01:06:20.392
Han Gyeong-wook
and Yoo In-gu are connected.

01:06:21.059 --> 01:06:22.769
They crashed into the Yeongseon River.
Are they dead?

01:06:22.853 --> 01:06:24.229
If they're lucky,
they might have survived.

01:06:24.313 --> 01:06:26.023
- Excuse me.
- I've got a bad feeling about this.

01:06:26.106 --> 01:06:27.649
- Is he a criminal?
- You said you're Bong Je-sun, right?

01:06:27.733 --> 01:06:30.152
The poor sap who lost
your home and got fired.

01:06:30.861 --> 01:06:33.363
Have you been spying
on Jeong Ho-myeong lately?

01:06:33.447 --> 01:06:34.823
What on earth are you hiding from me?

01:06:34.907 --> 01:06:38.202
- Sir, are you sure nothing's wrong?
- I got kicked out.

01:06:38.285 --> 01:06:40.370
How about we bring in a new member?

01:06:40.454 --> 01:06:42.498
- I'll do my best.
- I'll give it a shot.

01:06:42.623 --> 01:06:44.291
That's complete nonsense.

01:06:44.374 --> 01:06:46.001
As an agent
for the National Intelligence Service

01:06:46.084 --> 01:06:48.086
how could you team up with a thug?
